		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Housecat-sized black drake with shimmering, moist scales. Two legs and wings. Scavengers that lair near civilization.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 5, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +1 (1d4) or 1 <strong>S</strong>tygian gout, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Shadow Blend</strong>. Unless in bright light, ADV when sneaking or hiding.</p><p></p><p><strong>Stygian Gout</strong>. Gout ball of darkness within double near. All light in a close-sized cube around where the ball lands is extinguished. Cannot use again for 1d6 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
